---
import { SITE } from "../config";
---

<section id="agendar" class="relative mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 pb-24 pt-8 text-center">
  <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[36px] border border-[#4928C2]/50 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#5B2A62]/30 via-[#0B0D12] to-[#040607] px-8 py-16 sm:py-20 shadow-[0_0_70px_rgba(91,42,98,0.3)]">
    <!-- Ambient Soft Velvet Glow -->
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-24 left-1/2 h-72 w-72 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-[#5B2A62]/35 blur-3xl"></div>

    <p class="mb-4 inline-block rounded-full border border-[#BF40FA]/40 bg-[#040607]/80 px-4 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#E3D9FC]">
      ⏱️ Reserva de Demo por 7 Días · 1er Mes 100% Bonificado
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-outfit mx-auto max-w-3xl text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#F8F6FF] sm:text-5xl">
      Dejá de hacer de secretaria en WhatsApp y <span class="text-[#BF40FA]">activá tu Sistema NexoBow</span> hoy.
    </h2>

    <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-xl text-base text-[#E3D9FC]/80">
      Asegurá tu diseño exclusivo por rubro, los 3 Bonos de Acción Rápida y empezá a recibir pacientes pre-calificados en tu calendario esta misma semana.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
      <a
        href={SITE.whatsappUrl}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="group relative inline-flex items-center gap-4 rounded-full border border-[#BF40FA] bg-[#BF40FA] p-2 pl-7 pr-2.5 text-sm font-bold tracking-wide text-[#F8F6FF] shadow-[0_0_35px_rgba(191,64,250,0.4)] transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[#A82EE3]"
      >
        <span>Quiero activar mi Sistema NexoBow</span>
        <span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#040607] text-[#BF40FA] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-0.5">
          <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
          </svg>
        </span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
